# The kit's image needs the heart library, ARTIE, the report assets and the kit itself; nothing else is sent.
# Gradle's output is left out by module, not as every folder named build: a source package may be named build too.
*
!build-logic
!heart
!client
!docs/reports/assets
!kit
build-logic/build
heart/build
heart/*/build
client/build
client/*/build
**/.gradle
**/node_modules
client/runs
client/scripts
# Your keys stay on your machine: never sent to Docker as part of the build.
kit/.env
